Bundled fonts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Victor Mono  (default body font)
Copyright © 2024 Rune Bjørnerås (https://rubjo.github.io/victor-mono)
Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

The bundled font files and license text live in `assets/fonts/victor-mono/`.

JetBrains Mono  (also bundled, selectable)
Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

The bundled font files and license text live in `assets/fonts/jetbrains-mono/`.

Nerd Fonts Symbols Only / Symbols Nerd Font Mono  (symbol fallback fonts)
Bundled from Nerd Fonts `NerdFontsSymbolsOnly`, unmodified, in two versions so
the glyph pack covers both Nerd Font codepoint eras out of the box:
  - v3.4.0 - current layout (`assets/fonts/nerd-fonts-symbols/`).
  - v2.3.3 - legacy layout, fills the PUA slots v3 relocated, e.g. the archway
              `U+F557` and python `U+F81F` (`assets/fonts/nerd-fonts-symbols-v2/`).
Font-level license: MIT. Aggregated glyph sources include MIT, Apache-2.0,
CC-BY-4.0, OFL-1.1, and Unlicense components.

The bundled symbols fonts and MIT license text live in both directories. The
per-set credits, license references, and trademark note for the v3.4.0 face are
in `assets/fonts/nerd-fonts-symbols/NERD-FONTS-GLYPH-LICENSES.md`; the v2.3.3
face aggregates an older glyph-set selection that the table has not been
checked against.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Unicode data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The OdyTTY binary embeds tables derived from Unicode Character Database and
Unicode emoji data files, version 17.0.0: bidirectional classes, paired
brackets and mirroring (`src/core/bidi/`), emoji presentation and sequence
widths (`src/core/emoji_width/`), grapheme cluster break properties
(`src/core/grapheme/`), Indic cluster, width and virama-link properties
(`src/core/indic/`), and the glyph atlas combining-mark table
(`src/atlas/marks.rs`). Each generated file names its source files and records
their checksums in its header. The data is copyright Unicode, Inc. and is
